# s13_pattern_midi.scene — Snapshot_013 (W3) (docs/VISUAL_DIFF_1.9.4.md Part 2 §11).
# Tags: @font = depends on font metrics, @content = the stock card shows
# another project (B1t Crunch3r - Dimension X from Snapshot_015 on).
stock Snapshot_013.png
project Jude Frankum - Chill Out Room
script
  wait 300
  tap REC
  tap RIGHT x11        # track 12 (Midi 12), note column (Right moves the track;
                       # 2.x: x44 would now clamp at Midi 16)
end
